{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12134","headline":"杪秋南山西峰题准上人兰若 · 钱起","name":"杪秋南山西峰题准上人兰若","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向山看霁色，步步豁幽性。\n返照乱流明，寒空千嶂净。\n石门有余好，霞残月欲映。\n上诣远公庐，孤峰悬一迳。\n云里隔窗火，松下闻山磬。\n客到两忘言，猨心与禅定。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}